      "product_faq": [
        {
          "question": "Which color and EU size choices are listed?",
          "answer": "Red: EU 35–36, 37–38, 39–40, 40–41, 42–43, 44–45; Grey: EU 35–36, 37–38, 39–40, 40–41, 42–43, 44–45."
        },
        {
          "question": "Are the size labels individual or paired sizes?",
          "answer": "They are complete paired EU labels, including both 39–40 and 40–41 as separate choices. Keep the selected label intact when requesting pairs, and assess foot placement and toe room in the open-heel sample."
        },
        {
          "question": "What is the minimum order for the original style?",
          "answer": "The listed original-style minimum is 2 pairs. Quantity pricing is shown on this page; logo and custom packaging proposals are quoted separately."
        },
        {
          "question": "How can I request a sample?",
          "answer": "Send the selected color or lining option, EU size and delivery postcode for a sample quotation covering the pair, courier charge and proposed dispatch date."
        },
        {
          "question": "What should I send for logo or packaging requirements?",
          "answer": "Send the logo artwork, preferred placement, packaging brief and order quantity. The proposal for this style will set out the applicable minimum, cost and sample process."
        },
        {
          "question": "How can I get a delivered quotation?",
          "answer": "Send pair quantities by color and EU size, the destination postcode or port and the packaging request. The quotation separates product cost and freight and includes the proposed dispatch and transit schedule."
        }
      ],
